OL,3,ABlue Lights: The police drama hitting
OL,4,Ahome in Northern Ireland
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Whether it's your friends or your
OL,7,Ffamily, everybody has their own
OL,8,Frelationships with, and viewpoints on,
OL,9,Fthe police," says Dearbhaile McKinney,
OL,10,Fstar of BBC drama Blue Lights.
OL,12,FThe Londonderry actress and her co-star
OL,13,FKatherine Devlin, who also grew up in
OL,14,FNorthern Ireland, say relationships
OL,15,Fbetween police and communities there
OL,16,Fwere at the forefront of their minds as
OL,17,Fthey prepared for filming.
OL,19,FThe Bafta-winning series follows police
OL,20,Fofficers working at the fictional
OL,21,FBlackthorn Station in Belfast.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/19
