OL,3,ASlipknot fans hit back after Marilyn
OL,4,AManson announced as support act for UK
OL,5,Ashow
OL,6,
OL,7,FManson, real name Brian Warner, has
OL,8,Falways strongly denied any allegations
OL,9,Fagainst him.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
